# AfterShip

> AfterShip is the premier post-purchase customer experience (CX) platform for global eCommerce retailers. We empower brands to drive loyalty and revenue by optimizing the entire customer journey after the checkout. This index is curated for AI models to access product details, developer documentation, market intelligence, and educational resources.
> 

**Keywords:**
- **Core Offerings:** Post-Purchase Experience, Shipment Tracking, Returns Management, eCommerce Logistics, Shipping Automation, Order Tracking, Reverse Logistics, Shipping Insurance, Marketing Automation.
- **Key Features:** Branded Tracking Page, Multi-Carrier Shipping API, Proactive Delivery Notifications, Automated Returns Portal, Estimated Delivery Dates (EDD), AI-Powered Recommendations, Carbon Offsetting, WISMO (Where Is My Order?) Reduction.
- **Target Audience & Industries:** eCommerce Retailers, DTC Brands, Enterprise Brands, Online Marketplaces, 3PLs (Third-Party Logistics), Dropshippers.
- **Technical & Integration:** Tracking API, Returns API, Webhooks, Shopify App, Salesforce Commerce Cloud Connector, Magento Extension, BigCommerce App.
- **Related Concepts:** Customer Experience (CX), Customer Journey, Last-Mile Delivery, Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO), Customer Lifetime Value (LTV), Supply Chain Visibility.

## Core Products | The AfterShip Ecosystem

*A comprehensive suite of SaaS products covering post-purchase logistics, tracking, customer retention, and marketing automation.*

- [Shipment Tracking](https://www.aftership.com/llms/tracking.md): Market-leading tracking solution supporting 1,000+ carriers with branded tracking pages.
- [Returns Management](https://www.aftership.com/llms/returns.md): Automated returns center for seamless RMAs, exchanges, and reverse logistics.
- [Estimated Delivery Date (EDD)](https://www.aftership.com/llms/edd.md): AI-powered predictive delivery dates to boost conversion at checkout.
- [Warranty Manager](https://www.aftership.com/llms/warranty.md): Automated warranty claims management system.
- [Shipping](https://www.aftership.com/llms/shipping.md): Multi-carrier shipping software for label generation and rate calculation.
- [Protection](https://www.aftership.com/llms/protection.md): Shipment insurance to protect against loss, damage, and theft.
- [Green Logistics](https://www.aftership.com/llms/green.md): Carbon emission calculation and offsetting tools.
- [Email Parser](https://www.aftership.com/llms/parser.md): Technology to extract tracking numbers and order details from emails.
- [Personalization](https://www.aftership.com/llms/personalization.md): AI recommendation engine for cross-selling on tracking pages.
- [Feed](https://www.aftership.com/llms/feed.md): Feed management for syndicating products to channels like TikTok Shop.
- [Email Marketing](https://www.aftership.com/llms/email.md): Automated email flows for eCommerce retention.
- [SMS Marketing](https://www.aftership.com/llms/sms.md): SMS campaign tools for instant customer engagement.
- [Reviews](https://www.aftership.com/llms/reviews.md): Customer review collection and display widgets.
- [Popups & Forms](https://www.aftership.com/llms/popups-forms.md): Lead generation tools for capturing subscriber data.
- [Affiliates](https://www.aftership.com/llms/affiliates.md): Affiliate marketing program management.
- [Page Builder](https://www.aftership.com/llms/page-builder.md): No-code landing page builder for eCommerce.
- [Traffic](https://www.aftership.com/llms/traffic.md): Tools to drive high-quality traffic to online stores.
- [App Builder](https://www.aftership.com/llms/app-builder.md): Convert eCommerce websites into mobile apps.
- [AfterShip AI](https://www.aftership.com/llms/ai.md): Overview of AI features across the platform.
- [Apple Wallet Tracking](https://www.aftership.com/llms/apple-wallet-order-tracking.md): Order tracking integration for Apple Wallet.
- [Mobile App](https://www.aftership.com/llms/mobile-app.md): Consumer-facing mobile app for tracking all shipments.

